load @term/seed/code/space/vector/normed
  find normed-vector-space

# A Banach algebra: a complete normed algebra, a vector space that is at once an algebra and a Banach space (a complete
# normed space), with the norm submultiplicative. It is the setting for functional analysis and the spectral theory of
# operators. The form carries the underlying normed space; completeness and the submultiplicative norm are the laws.
form banach-algebra
  link space, like normed-vector-space
